<title>USA: USDA releases GSM-102 credits for Central America.</title>
<headline>USDA releases GSM-102 credits for Central America.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday said released an additional $40 million in export credit guarantees to the Central American Region.</p>
<p>USDA said with the release, the entire $80 million earmarked for the region under the GSM-102 program for fiscal year 1997 are available to exporters.</p>
</text>
